message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fishbonett: Tensor-network dynamics of vibronic open quantum systems"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained Python package for propagating the dynamics of multi-site
  vibronic (fishbone-like) open-quantum-system models using matrix-product-state
  and tree-tensor-network TEBD methods.
type: software
authors:
